; claude: image files: getting them from the disk or the network
; (Download), decoding them (PNG, JPEG, GIF, ... via stb_image) and
; caching them, down to plain pixel buffers, as 2D images with their GIF
; animation (Image_decode) or as 3D textures (Texture_decode); drawing
; them is up to the user (Cairo surfaces in playground/native/,
; graphics/core/'s Blit in playground/software/, the 3D backends'
; samplers and GL textures).
;
; A private library (see graphics/core/dune), installed as part of
; elm_playground_native_common, the package the native 2D backends
; already depend on (and the 3D ones now too).
(library
 (name graphics_images)
 (package elm_playground_native_common)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries
   logs
   stb_image
   curl
 )
)
